{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在Windows 11測試一項小改動，讓用户更容易永久關閉粘滯鍵和篩選鍵的快捷鍵提示。新版彈窗加入「不再通過此快捷鍵啓用粘滯鍵」等選項；用户勾選後，Windows就不會再反覆詢問是否開啓相關功能，減少輸入或遊戲時被打斷的情況。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585474.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.641662+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T09:11:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"eeac3e0a31875d89b5ff06dcc0af0ca30d0e5da38b67d023106028242539d325","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}